The three measures he wants CEOs to focus on are message, relevance to the buyer, and unique differentiation. In notation, the sales claim has to answer $\text{Why this problem?}
\qquad
\text{Why this buyer?}
\qquad
\text{Why this company?}$ If any one of those is vague, the sales motion loses force.

