A concise update rule for the conversation is $\begin{aligned}
\text{homework}
&\longrightarrow
\text{questions},\\
\text{questions}
&\longrightarrow
\text{true need},\\
\text{true need}
&\longrightarrow
\text{pain point},\\
\text{pain point}
&\longrightarrow
\text{mutual solution}.\end{aligned}$ The important word is mutual. The seller is not simply pushing inventory. The seller is making the buyer’s own decision legible.

