The risk principle is qualitative: $\text{perfect success rate}
\quad\Rightarrow\quad
\text{risk meter may be too low}.$ This is not expected-value mathematics, and the transcript does not support a probability model. It is an operating warning. If every investment works, perhaps the investor is not taking enough uncertainty to find exceptional outcomes.

